<title>USA: United Mobile Homes Inc Q4 net increases.</title>
<headline>United Mobile Homes Inc Q4 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Years Ended December 31,</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues			 $14,533,000     $13,333,000</p>
<p> Net Income				 3,730,000	 2,492,000</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			   .61		 .44</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>						6,155,000	 5,693,000</p>
<p>			    For the Three Months Ended December 31,</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues			   3,717,000	 3,399,000</p>
<p> Net Income				   965,000	   713,000</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			   .16		 .12</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>						6,377,000	 5,834,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for 1996 includes a gain on the sale of land of $290,000.</p>
</text>
